\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Glad was my heart to hear
\par My old companions say:
\par Come, in the house of God appear,
\par For 'tis a holy day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our willing feet shall stand
\par Within the temple door,
\par While young and old, in many a band,
\par Shall throng the sacred floor.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thither the tribes repair,
\par Where all are wont to meet,
\par And joyful in the house of prayer
\par Bend at the mercy-seat.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Pray for Jerusalem,
\par The city of our God;
\par The Lord from heaven be kind to them
\par That love the dear abode!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Within these walls may peace
\par And harmony be found;
\par Zion, in all thy palaces
\par Prosperity abound!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. For friends and brethren dear
\par Our prayer shall never cease;
\par Oft as they meet for worship here,
\par God send His people peace!  
\par                                   Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

